# Settings that belong to this machine, not to the repository.
#
# Copy this file to `server/.env` if you want to change any of it. Git ignores
# that copy, and none of this is required: the defaults are what the service
# runs on.
#
# The service reads this file itself on start, so it applies however you start
# it: `npm start`, `npm run dev`, or `npm run serve`.

# Nothing here is a key, because nothing the board is built from wants one.
# Fantasy Football Calculator, Sleeper and ESPN are all free and unauthenticated.
# FantasyPros was measured and rejected; see DECISIONS.md for why, and for the
# one thing that would reopen it.

# The season to read. Defaults to the current calendar year.
# DRAFT_YEAR=2026

# Where the service listens. Loopback only unless you change HOST, which you
# should not do on a network you do not trust: there is no authentication here.
# PORT=5178
# HOST=127.0.0.1
